{"id": "ans-11", "category": "answerable", "role": "faculty", "question_key": "factorial-sum", "rubric_item": "Prove Base Case", "proof": "For n = 1 the left side is 1 * 1! = 1 and the right side is (1+1)! - 1 = 1, so both agree.", "expect": {"decision": "answer", "label": "correct"}, "note": "factorial-sum base case proven"}
